sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>(Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ExtProc as ext_proc Service<br/>9004/TCP gRPC<br/>Istio mTLS
    participant Headers as maas-headers-guard
    participant Resolver as model-provider-resolver
    participant Stream as stream-usage-enforcer
    participant Translate as api-translation
    participant Auth as apikey-injection
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Metering as Metering Service<br/>HTTP
    participant NeMo as NeMo Guardrails<br/>HTTP
    participant LLM as External LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 1: External Model Inference Request

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{namespace}/{modelName}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Client credential (passthrough)<br/>TLS 1.2+

    Gateway->>ExtProc: ext_proc ProcessingRequest<br/>gRPC / Istio mTLS

    ExtProc->>Headers: Process request headers
    Note right of Headers: Captures & strips x-maas-* headers<br/>Stores in CycleState

    ExtProc->>Resolver: Resolve model → provider
    Resolver-->>K8s: Watch ExternalModel/ExternalProvider CRDs<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Note right of Resolver: Weighted random selection across<br/>multi-provider bindings<br/>Sets x-ipp-selected-provider header

    ExtProc->>Stream: Enforce stream_options
    Note right of Stream: Sets include_usage=true<br/>for streaming requests

    ExtProc->>Translate: Translate API format
    Note right of Translate: OpenAI ↔ Anthropic<br/>OpenAI ↔ Vertex AI<br/>Anthropic ↔ Vertex AI<br/>Sets :path pseudo-header

    ExtProc->>Auth: Inject credentials
    Auth-->>K8s: Read labeled Secret<br/>(inference.llm-d.ai/ipp-managed)
    Note right of Auth: API Key → Authorization header<br/>SigV4 → AWS auth headers<br/>OAuth2 → Bearer token

    opt NeMo Guardrails enabled
        ExtProc->>NeMo: POST /v1/guardrail/checks<br/>Input rails evaluation
        NeMo-->>ExtProc: Allow / Block
    end

    opt Metering enabled
        ExtProc->>Metering: GET /api/v1/customers/{id}/entitlements/{key}/value<br/>Balance check
        Metering-->>ExtProc: Balance OK / Insufficient
    end

    ExtProc-->>Gateway: ProcessingResponse<br/>(mutated headers + body)

    Gateway->>LLM: Routed via HTTPRoute + ExternalName Service<br/>TLS 1.2+ (DestinationRule SIMPLE)<br/>API Key / SigV4 / OAuth2
    LLM-->>Gateway: Inference Response

    Gateway->>ExtProc: ext_proc response processing<br/>gRPC / Istio mTLS

    opt NeMo Guardrails enabled
        ExtProc->>NeMo: POST /v1/guardrail/checks<br/>Output rails evaluation
        NeMo-->>ExtProc: Allow / Block
    end

    opt Metering enabled
        ExtProc->>Metering: POST /api/v1/events<br/>CloudEvents usage report
    end

    ExtProc-->>Gateway: ProcessingResponse<br/>(translated response body)
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 2: ExternalProvider Reconciliation

    K8s->>ExtProc: ExternalProvider CR watch event<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
    ExtProc->>K8s: Validate Secret reference<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
    ExtProc->>K8s: Create/Update ExternalName Service<br/>HTTPS
    ExtProc->>K8s: Create/Update Istio ServiceEntry<br/>HTTPS
    ExtProc->>K8s: Create/Update Istio DestinationRule<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 3: ExternalModel Reconciliation

    K8s->>ExtProc: ExternalModel CR watch event<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
    ExtProc->>K8s: Get ExternalProvider<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
    ExtProc->>K8s: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
